title: $:/mf/macros
tags: $:/tags/Global

\whitespace trim

\procedure key(command, fallback)
<span data-mf-key=<<command>>><$text text={{{ [<fallback>!is[blank]else<command>] }}}/></span>
\end

\procedure cmd(name)
<$link to=<<name>>><code><$text text=<<name>>/></code></$link>
\end

\procedure live(name)
<div data-mf-live=<<name>>>

</div>
\end

\procedure list-kind(kind)
<ul>

<$list filter="[tag<currentTiddler>field:kind<kind>sort[]]">

<li>

<$link/> — <$view field="summary"/>

</li>

</$list>

</ul>
\end

\procedure topic-full()
<$list filter="[tag<currentTiddler>]">

!! <$link/>

<$transclude $mode="block"/>

</$list>
\end

\procedure catalog(tag)
<ul>

<$list filter="[tag<tag>sort[]]">

<li>

<$link/> — <$view field="summary"/>

</li>

</$list>

</ul>

<$let prefix={{{ [[$:/mf/gen/]addsuffix<tag>addsuffix[/]] }}}>

<$list filter="[prefix<prefix>get[target]!is[tiddler]sort[]first[]]" variable="_">

Not documented yet:

<ul>

<$list filter="[prefix<prefix>get[target]!is[tiddler]sort[]]" variable="target">

<li>

<code><$text text=<<target>>/></code>

</li>

</$list>

</ul>

</$list>

</$let>
\end

The project's procedures, usable from every note (docs/doc-wiki-proposal.md,
"Sous-ensemble de wikitext autorisé"):

* `<<key "command" [fallback]>>` — the key bound to a GUI command, filled in
  from the live keybinding table by the help panel.
* `<<cmd "name">>` — a link to a command's note, in code form.
* `<<live name>>` — a zone the help panel fills at display (`grammar`: the
  current simplified-query grammar). A block: put it on a line of its own.
* `<<list-kind kind>>` — the notes tagged with this one, of one kind.
* `<<topic-full>>` — every note tagged with this one, in full.
* `<<catalog "tag">>` — a catalog's notes, then what the code has and the wiki
  does not document yet.
